## CURRENT-INVENTORY BUILD

**Concentrate target: 5400 µL.** The table is the sole executable formula. All raw stock doses are at least 10 µL. The “active ppm” values are pipeline-compatible active-volume equivalents in the 5,400 µL concentrate. They are not strict laboratory ppm w/w: strict ppm w/w remains HOLD until each liquid density and the final concentrate mass are measured. Ambrox Super is especially provisional because its authority is ~33% w/v, not w/w.

S35-T2 v2 supersedes the unmade v1 draft. The v1 model placed Cassis Base at roughly 19 times the ACP headspace OAV and citrus at 60.9% of opening OAV. The repair reduces citrus and cassis, raises pineapple body/skin, and strengthens cedar–Ambrox–Romandolide depth. This is an identity-linked rebase, not proof that v2 will smell better.

